WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:01.206
- Okay.

00:00:01.206 --> 00:00:02.830
Before we start I asked
to brag on you because

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.240
you did something very nice.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.573
And I don't even know
if you remember. But...

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.320
I was going to do something and
then I couldn't or whatever.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.617
And then you sent me a message saying,

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:12.030
"Hey, we're just thinking
of you and praying for you."

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.050
And you were so nice, like
behind the scenes you are.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.331
He's very kind.

00:00:15.331 --> 00:00:16.997
- That's... Thank you, thank
you. (audience clapping)

00:00:16.997 --> 00:00:17.830
- I wanted to lead with that.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.577
But thank you so much for being
part of our we love LA week.

00:00:20.577 --> 00:00:21.410
- Yes, thank you.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.967
- So you're in the My Little
Pony next generation movie.

00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:24.800
- Yes, yes.
- That's exciting.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.633
(audience cheering)

00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:29.130
So were you aware of the die hard, like,

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.770
my little pony fan base,
and it's the bronies?

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.710
- Yeah, the brony.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.440
I was, I was aware cause my kids,

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.300
when they're like four
years old, five years old,

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.680
they had like My Little Pony,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.530
I believe it was equestria.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.400
It was like they had a series.
- Yeah, I've seen.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.740
- Yeah, they have a series and my kids,

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.530
they like, they're begging my wife and I.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:49.324
They would just say like
please take us to this,

00:00:49.324 --> 00:00:53.470
to see like the first ever
animated My Little Pony movie.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:54.303
- Yeah.
- And so...

00:00:54.303 --> 00:00:56.260
This is really in many ways,

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.175
just kind of like a love letter
to my kids of yesterday and

00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:00.748
to pay it forward because

00:01:00.748 --> 00:01:03.720
I had so much fun just kind
of learning all about...

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.180
I, I knew about equestria.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.123
I knew about that whole
world like years ago.

00:01:07.123 --> 00:01:07.990
- Yeah.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:09.620
- And so to be, you know,

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.692
it's a very full circle moment.

00:01:11.692 --> 00:01:12.525
- Yeah.

00:01:12.525 --> 00:01:13.670
- That was a main reason
why, why I did it.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.530
And in many ways,

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.709
it's a shout out to my
kids back in the day.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:17.542
(audience cheering)

00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:18.490
- No, that's so cool.

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:19.910
- You were in Crazy Rich Asians.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.040
God, I love that film so much.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.673
- Thank you, thank you.
(audience cheering)

00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:23.763
- And it was a big step.

00:01:23.763 --> 00:01:25.016
It was a big step for
representations on film.

00:01:25.016 --> 00:01:26.760
So how do you feel about
the new Marvel movies?

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.593
- Yes.

00:01:27.593 --> 00:01:28.480
- Like Shang-Chi and the Eternals.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.949
I'm very excited.
- Yes.

00:01:29.949 --> 00:01:30.782
- How do you feel?

00:01:30.782 --> 00:01:34.036
- I just saw, I saw
Shang-Chi and it is my...

00:01:34.036 --> 00:01:34.869
- Did you?

00:01:34.869 --> 00:01:35.702
- Yes.

00:01:35.702 --> 00:01:37.959
- It is my favorite MCU movie of all time.

00:01:37.959 --> 00:01:38.792
(audience clapping)

00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:39.625
It is my favorite.

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:40.458
- I'm so excited.

00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:41.730
- And you had Simu Liu on the show, right?

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.010
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:45.000
- He is amazing in this.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:45.833
He is the real...

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.190
I've known him from back in the day,

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.630
even when I had like my show, Dr. Kenny,

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:50.650
we would just hang out.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:51.810
Because he was on Kim's Convenience,

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.400
this great show in Canada.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.730
He is the real deal.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:57.740
He is a real life
superhero on an off screen.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.540
He's going to inspire
so many Asian Americans,

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:03.570
because you're seeing that
representation and doing it well.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.790
And then Awkwafina, she was my daughter in

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:06.790
Crazy Rich Asians.
- Yeah.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:10.335
- And to me, she is
just a global treasure.

00:02:10.335 --> 00:02:11.531
- People love her.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:12.559
- So to have that and

00:02:12.559 --> 00:02:14.140
Michelle Yeoh, Tony Leung.

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:14.973
It...

00:02:14.973 --> 00:02:16.530
- It looks like action packed.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.671
- It's action packed.

00:02:17.671 --> 00:02:20.420
The action scenes are the best of any

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.477
Marvel movies I've ever seen.
- I'm so excited.

00:02:22.477 --> 00:02:24.699
- And it was just proud and emotional.

00:02:24.699 --> 00:02:26.190
Where as an Asian-American,

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.424
you're seeing this
representation on screen.

00:02:28.424 --> 00:02:29.257
- Yeah.

00:02:29.257 --> 00:02:30.274
- So it really is...
- It's so important.

00:02:30.274 --> 00:02:31.107
- It's so important.

00:02:31.107 --> 00:02:33.015
And, and the fact that it's just good.

00:02:33.015 --> 00:02:33.848
- Yeah.

00:02:33.848 --> 00:02:35.333
- It's just a great, great movie.

00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:36.330
- Yeah, but it's also a bonus, cause then

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.167
little kids that might
look like them think,

00:02:37.167 --> 00:02:38.650
oh, I can do that.
- Exactly.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.060
- To have that representation and

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.950
Jon Chu, who directed Crazy Rich Asians,

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.669
he said, this is more than
a movie, it's a movement

00:02:44.669 --> 00:02:46.505
- Yeah. And I think that to me, it's,

00:02:46.505 --> 00:02:50.760
it's not just one person
hitting it and crossing over.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.370
It's just everyone in this community,

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.860
like pushing it forward, you
know, like basically you,

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.500
you want to lift the tide so all

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.175
of the boats can sail on it.
- Absolutely.

00:02:59.175 --> 00:03:00.008
- So that...
- Room for everybody.

00:03:00.008 --> 00:03:00.841
(audience cheering) - So
that's what we want to do.

00:03:00.841 --> 00:03:01.674
Yeah, absolutely.
- That's a great...

00:03:01.674 --> 00:03:02.757
- Yeah, yeah.

